lines sail the Douro from Porto?","a":"Seven confirmed — Viking, AmaWaterways, Avalon, CroisiEurope, Scenic, Emerald and Uniworld — because Porto is the single embarkation gateway for the ~8-day run up to Regua, Pinhao and the Spanish border.","source":"cruisecritic.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"What''s the difference between Port and Douro wine?","a":"Both come from the same Alto Douro terraces, but Port is fortified and aged in the Vila Nova de Gaia lodges (an 18th-century tradition), while Douro DOC is unfortified table wine — taste both, one at a Gaia lodge, one at a valley quinta.","source":"whc.unesco.org","si_tag":"culinary"},{"q":"Where should I stay for a luxury Douro base?","a":"Two anchors: Six Senses Douro Valley, a restored 19th-century manor with a vineyard-heritage spa, for the valley itself; or The Yeatman above the Gaia Port lodges — 109 terraced river-view rooms, a two-Michelin-star table and a Caudalie Vinotherapie spa.","source":"scottdunn.com","si_tag":"ultra"},{"q":"Is the Douro good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — a quiet, high-romance wine landscape: a river-view quinta suite, a private terrace over the vines at sunset, and a Michelin dinner across from Porto''s lit Ribeira. It reads couples, not crowds.","source":"the-yeatman-hotel.com","si_tag":"romance"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Douro Valley Travel Guide: River Cruises, Port Wine, the UNESCO Terraces & Porto","meta_description":"Plan Portugal''s Douro Valley — TravelWell''s second great river-cruise anchor: 7 cruise lines from Porto, the UNESCO Alto Douro terraces, the home of Port, The Yeatman''s two Michelin stars, Six Senses Douro Valley.","slug":"douro-valley-portugal","primary_keyword":"Douro Valley travel guide","long_tail":["Douro river cruise from Porto 2026","Alto Douro UNESCO wine region","Port wine Vila Nova de Gaia lodges","The Yeatman two Michelin stars","Six Senses Douro Valley","Pinhao Regua quinta tasting"],"search_language":"pt-PT","local_keywords":["Vale do Douro","cruzeiro no Douro","Alto Douro Vinhateiro UNESCO","vinho do Porto","caves de Vila Nova de Gaia","Douro DOC","Pinhao","Peso da Regua","quinta do Douro","The Yeatman","Six Senses Douro Valley","vindima"],"hreflang":["en","pt-PT"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-27","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-27","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/portugal","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:06Z","source_updated":"2026-08-11T10:21:44+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"advisory_updated":"2025-12-23","note":"Portugal — the FCDO names no advisory against travel"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-27","hits":8,"misses":14,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to My Sports Travel (participant); spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"river","name":"river","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"live"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"culture","name":"Culture & History","status":"future"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future"},{"si":"wellness","name":"Wellness Spas & Retreats","status":"future"},{"si":"senior","name":"senior","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Six Senses Douro Valley — restored 19th-c. manor among the vines","why_ultra":"northern Portugal''s finest, vineyard-heritage spa, valley-terrace views","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~€500-1,200+/night"},{"name":"The Ye